1
00:00:00,991 --> 00:00:02,371
(Amy:)Better?

2
00:00:02,493 --> 00:00:04,993
(Amy:)Baguettes.
Yes, I like baguettes.

3
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:08,040
(Sheldon:)What exactly are you doing?

4
00:00:08,165 --> 00:00:10,545
(Amy:)Determining baseline fear levels
in capuchin monkeys

5
00:00:10,601 --> 00:00:12,601
(Amy:)by measuring their response
to visual stimuli.

6
00:00:12,736 --> 00:00:14,006
(Sheldon:)So, goofing off.

7
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,840
(Sheldon:)As I was saying, I'm done with work
and Leonard's not.

8
00:00:19,944 --> 00:00:22,054
(Sheldon:)So good news,
you get to take me home.

9
00:00:22,112 --> 00:00:24,682
(Sheldon:)Play your cards right,
I'll let you drive me

10
00:00:24,748 --> 00:00:27,748
(Sheldon:)past the lot
where the buses park at night.

11
00:00:27,785 --> 00:00:30,785
(Amy:)I can't leave now, Sheldon.
I'm very busy.

12
00:00:30,888 --> 00:00:32,458
(Amy:)Besides, why would I want to do you
a favour

13
00:00:32,556 --> 00:00:34,596
(Amy:)after the way you treated me
in the cafeteria?

14
00:00:34,625 --> 00:00:36,935
Image number tour: boa constrictor.

15
00:00:40,965 --> 00:00:43,915
(Sheldon:)What on earth are you talking about?

16
00:00:43,934 --> 00:00:47,744
My behavior in the cafeteria
was delightful.

17
00:00:47,871 --> 00:00:50,981
(Sheldon:)Maybe your friend Gunderson needs
to head over to IKEA

18
00:00:51,041 --> 00:00:53,421
and assemble a sense of humor.

19
00:00:54,445 --> 00:00:57,725
(Amy:)You embarrassed me in front of
my colleagues on my first day here.

20
00:00:58,582 --> 00:01:01,062
Image number five:
kitten in a teacup.

